
# 2025-11-21 05:53:51.797480
+Code the following app
+```
+Description:
+Genesis NFT Tracker monitors new Genesis NFT drops in real-time, providing insights into floor prices, rarity, and market activity. Stay ahead of the market and never miss key minting opportunities.
+
+Key Features:
+ • Real-time tracking of Genesis NFT launches and floor prices.
+ • Alerts for price changes or new drops.
+ • Visual charts for rarity, trading volume, and market trends.
+ • Support for multiple marketplaces (OpenSea, LooksRare, Magic Eden, etc.).
+ • Historical data tracking for past drops.
+
+Target Users:
+NFT collectors, traders, and enthusiasts who want to track Genesis NFT launches and market dynamics.
+
+Usage Instructions:
+ 1. Select the collections or NFT projects to monitor.
+ 2. View real-time floor prices, rarity metrics, and trading volume.
+ 3. Set alerts for drops or significant price movements.
+ 4. Analyze trends to make informed minting and trading decisions.
+
+Benefits:
+ • Stay informed about the latest Genesis NFT drops.
+ • Identify high-value NFTs early.
+ • Make data-driven decisions for minting and trading.
+```
+
+Generate an app logo and update the app metadata title and description.

